                "On the Isocyanate-Staith HIL stand, phosgenator P-4 mixer AE is already 58 pps "
                "(cap 16) even though the COCl2 header is a quiet 7.6 bar under 9.5. MDA at 16 t/h "
                "is armed; the mockup AE, not the header PT, is the dispatch veto. A header-led "
                "policy would have poured MDA into a growling mixer.",